## 8. Perspectives covered (multi-perspective critique input, L09)

- **Correctness / arithmetic:** the denominator is frozen before any source is read (§1,
  §3.2); the aggregation is closed-form (§4.1); `n_a` versus `absent` is decided by rule,
  not by extractor discretion (§4.2). ✔
- **Falsifiability (the point of the exercise):** the probe can return NO-GO by two
  independent routes — veto and ratio — and `INSUFFICIENT_SOURCE` also terminates NO-GO.
  A design in which only GO is reachable would not test A8. Δ3's requirement that every
  SAEOS spec carry a mechanically checkable conformance assertion is met by the four
  accept checks (§10). ✔
- **Adversarial:** the main attack on a spike like this is denominator-shopping — quietly
  excluding fields that would score badly. Countered by freezing the census here, by
  requiring a `note` on every non-`extractable` cell, by publishing `type_presence`
  alongside the ratio so type-level absence cannot hide inside `n_a`, and by the fail-safe
  ambiguity rule. ✔
- **Non-authority (FPL-3):** the probe reads sealed artifacts and writes one review
  document. It creates no node, mints no evidence, touches no gate, and cannot advance any
  goal. A NO-GO does not delete SAEOS-1 — it routes §8's S1 to redesign, exactly as D7
  ratified. ✔
- **Blast radius (A-2):** additive, non-TCB (`reviews/`, not `constitution/` or `kernel/`).
  Expected **SOFT**. This design document itself is `design/`-only and touches nothing. ✔
- **Context economy (FPL-4):** 267 enumerated cells across 3 goals is bounded and fits one
  worker session. The per-cell ledger is the bulk of the report; the frontmatter carries
  the decision, so a reader who needs only the verdict pays 2 lines. ✔
- **Governance (×3, CER-5):** the probe recommends; it does not legislate. A NO-GO is
  routed to the founder as an S1 redesign trigger, not applied as a spec amendment. ✔
- **Sample validity:** addressed and *not* resolved — A5 is carried openly, with the
  Trace-A stub caveat that plausibly biases the sample toward understatement. ✔
- **Reproducibility:** a second operator running §5 against the same SourceSet should
  produce the same ledger; divergence is itself a finding about artifact ambiguity. ✔

